  "description": "E-A aggregation: gains over RisAbsent, retention rho(tau), tau_half and the pre-registered hypotheses H-A1..H-A3 (paper/preregistration/E-A.md)",
  "assumptions": [
    "gain CI: Student-t over 20 paired per-batch dB gains (19 d.o.f.)",
    "tau_half CI: Student-t over 20 per-batch log10 tau_half (censored batches clipped to the sweep range and counted)",
    "evaluation rule per point: mid",
    "AP offset d0 = 0.5 m from the user line, on the side away from the RIS (documented V-WCL deviation; side is an ENG choice)",
    "A1 partition: factor applied to the LOS path only (DESIGN 5.2); RIS hops unattenuated [ENG]",
    "one RWP trajectory realization (scenario seed 20261010) shared by every point (paired)",
    "ProbeBandit evaluated with FastProbeBandit (bitwise-identical decisions, O(K) means)",
    "batch path evaluated in vectorized form (experiments/ea.py): channel sampled on a 1 mm (0.5 mm above 1.5 GHz) grid and interpolated complex-linearly; see interp_check",
    "5 ms pieces split at switch times, each evaluated at its mid point",
    "controller channel model = scene model on a 1 cm GridChannel (oracle geometry)",
    "command latency 1 ms; switch at t_b + 1 ms (RIS-time convention)"
  ],
